<</AP<</N 172 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 3 0 R /Rect[ 111.236 271.434 537.885 418.342]/Subtype/Widget/T(q1)/Type/Annot/V(Change control is vital to cybersecurity, since technology is an ever-evolving asset. With that constant evolution, so is the constant of increasing threats and their impact on operations. Thus, with change control management, businesses can stay up to date with the changes in technology, and are enabled to secure themselves against any threats and find vulnerabilities. If a business does not invest in change control management, they wouldn't be up to date in their technology in a short period of time, compromising their operations, assets, and individuals due to being obsolete and open to cyber attacks.)>>
